/T (Our long-term goal is to develop this project beyond a hackathon prototype into a fully functional environmental gaming website. We would begin by improving the core gameplay, fixing bugs, and collecting feedback from students. Next, we would build additional levels, save-player-progress features, and a more immersive storyline. Once the game is reliable, we could launch a website, collaborate with schools and environmental organisations, and explore sustainable ways to fund further development.)
